        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "25646870-d8f7-3c71-b4a7-d9eddc46e60d",
                "word": "subrepticement",
                "pos": "adv",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6cdcb21c-f996-37c2-9ccd-f8bb21eee761",
                        "entry_id": "25646870-d8f7-3c71-b4a7-d9eddc46e60d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "D’une manière subreptice."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "674364df-d870-4df8-aab1-b82af6f1add4",
                                "sense_id": "6cdcb21c-f996-37c2-9ccd-f8bb21eee761",
                                "text": "Bert se hâta de les suivre, mais il lui fut impossible d’avancer assez vite et assez subrepticement pour surprendre en quel endroit ils avaient caché les vivres."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7e4de161-c4ab-4fd4-9e2d-00deacb7eeb2",
                                "sense_id": "6cdcb21c-f996-37c2-9ccd-f8bb21eee761",
                                "text": "Il se penche sur sa main, mais tire subrepticement de sa poche une loupe de bijoutier et en profite pour examiner les bagues de plus près."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8c2e2e5c-7396-4478-96c2-8b72978a9473",
                                "sense_id": "6cdcb21c-f996-37c2-9ccd-f8bb21eee761",
                                "text": "7 mai 42 – La statue de Jeanne d’Arc a été subrepticement pavoisée et les Allemands ne s’en sont aperçus que quelques heures plus tard."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f8874222-9738-448f-ad6c-796ae4cf1678",
                                "sense_id": "6cdcb21c-f996-37c2-9ccd-f8bb21eee761",
                                "text": "Il me semble que la méconnaissance des pièges totalitaires du langage juridique est souvent profonde dans nos États. Si les justiciables n'y prennent garde, le chancre du totalitarisme peut prendre souche, subrepticement, et la liberté individuelle y perdre, lentement mais sûrement, des plumes."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cf25c3a3-9452-422b-8acd-63452c4afd29",
                                "sense_id": "6cdcb21c-f996-37c2-9ccd-f8bb21eee761",
                                "text": "Mais aujourd'hui, la modernisation des installations fait planer un grave péril sur les 70 sites fortifiés à usage agricole. A Cussy-le-Châtel, à Chalvosson (Villaines), à Chevigny-lès-Millery, les exploitants rebouchent subrepticement les fossés pour étendre leurs bâtiments."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1e695ce4-0f16-4164-bed4-ef53d9b74783",
                        "source_entry_id": "25646870-d8f7-3c71-b4a7-d9eddc46e60d",
                        "source_sense_id": "6cdcb21c-f996-37c2-9ccd-f8bb21eee761",
                        "target_lang_word": "surreptitiously",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "surreptitiously",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fdab75f8-718e-3f09-9142-9581bff20d82",
                                        "entry_id": "10b527de-25c0-314e-ac05-3b76805ce20a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In a surreptitious manner; stealthily, furtively, secretly."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6f0eed3d-5ad9-4036-98ad-b3b6da5d606e",
                                                "sense_id": "fdab75f8-718e-3f09-9142-9581bff20d82",
                                                "text": "Hiro and Chuck grab the closest thing they can find to a corner table. Hiro buttonholes a waiter and surreptitiously orders a pitcher of Pub Special, mixed half and half with nonalcoholic beer."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cbf620ae-a8f0-4a41-9fd8-1ddbb82ef371",
                                                "sense_id": "fdab75f8-718e-3f09-9142-9581bff20d82",
                                                "text": "They stayed together during three dances, went out on to the terrace, explored wherever they were permitted to explore, paid two visits to the buffet, and enjoyed themselves much in the same way as if they had been school-children surreptitiously breaking loose from an assembly of grown-ups."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c4b8f192-fc8d-46ec-b636-8fa904d9f16a",
                                                "sense_id": "fdab75f8-718e-3f09-9142-9581bff20d82",
                                                "text": "While Brown distracted the usually hyperfocused Mangini, safety Kerry Rhodes and linebackers Eric Barton and Jonathan Vilma grabbed a cooler of Gatorade and surreptitiously assumed their positions according to plan."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9b99d2df-4ee7-4472-bbb8-94c7b8b426fd",
                        "source_entry_id": "25646870-d8f7-3c71-b4a7-d9eddc46e60d",
                        "source_sense_id": "6cdcb21c-f996-37c2-9ccd-f8bb21eee761",
                        "target_lang_word": "stealthily",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "stealthily",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "06807067-8591-3619-a031-483a788f954b",
                                        "entry_id": "78bb9ecb-388d-3e6e-8715-e6e77961026e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In a stealthy manner, furtively."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "796ff500-915d-4a3d-be6e-a0bba09abe23",
                                                "sense_id": "06807067-8591-3619-a031-483a788f954b",
                                                "text": "The dog obeyed the significant beck of his finger, and they drew off, stealthily, together."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "52d5ac8f-3791-483f-8436-773568419032",
                                                "sense_id": "06807067-8591-3619-a031-483a788f954b",
                                                "text": "So intent was he upon this personal appraisement of his features that he did not hear the parting of the tall grass behind him as a great body pushed itself stealthily through the jungle; nor did his companion, the ape, hear either, for he was drinking and the noise of his sucking lips and gurgles of satisfaction drowned the quiet approach of the intruder."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f212e27a-f559-4626-8580-d3eae8e8e972",
                        "source_entry_id": "25646870-d8f7-3c71-b4a7-d9eddc46e60d",
                        "source_sense_id": "6cdcb21c-f996-37c2-9ccd-f8bb21eee761",
                        "target_lang_word": "sneakily",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "sneakily",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8cc77c35-a7d6-35a8-b42b-47f392c67c15",
                                        "entry_id": "4d1c3777-b415-38fa-bc53-d5217eefc874",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In a sneaky manner."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c0d67477-85ca-40df-b22f-7dc34710d97f",
                                                "sense_id": "8cc77c35-a7d6-35a8-b42b-47f392c67c15",
                                                "text": "But on the occasions that he did do something actively nasty, he was satanically good at insinuating himself so sneakily into your most sensitive spots that if you did not know him well you could end up thinking you were being unfair to him when he annoyed you."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "065cf7cc-8129-4732-b077-22ab1ceeae00",
                        "source_entry_id": "25646870-d8f7-3c71-b4a7-d9eddc46e60d",
                        "source_sense_id": "6cdcb21c-f996-37c2-9ccd-f8bb21eee761",
